  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Genius follow-on investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of up to EUR 50 million in Green Genius International B.V.  (&quot;the Company&quot;), a renewable energy developer and independent power producer  with existing operations across Europe. This operation follows an initial EUR  100 million investment made by the EBRD in 2024.  The EBRD&apos;s EUR 50 million equity investment will be allocated to financing the  renewable energy and battery energy storage system (&quot;BESS&quot;) pipeline projects  across Latvia, Lithuania and Poland, significantly reducing greenhouse gas  emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
